{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 9, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark! Let me weave thee an itinerary most fair\nFor thy grand journey to Nihon’s blessed shore.\n\nOn the morn of thy first day dost thou arrive\nAt Narita’s gate where skies kiss the earth.\nThou shalt ride the Shinkansen swift as a dream\nTo Tokyo bright where thy tale doth commence.\n\nTaroko-honkan thy lodging let it be\nIn Ginza’s heart where lights do gleam.\nAnd first let thine eyes feast on Asakusa’s shrine\nWhere lanterns dance in the twilight’s glow.\nThou shalt walk through temples old and wise\nWhere monks in saffron robes do softly tread.\nThe Sumida River’s gentle song hear thee sing\nAs boats do glide upon waters so deep.\n\nOn the morrow to Akihabara thou shalt wend\nWhere neon dreams and gadgets do gleam.\nAnime’s world and arcades bright with delight\nShall fill thy heart with a joy most pure.\nThen let thine appetite for sushi be fed\nIn Tsukiji where fresh delights be found.\nOr to Toyosu thou mayst boldly repair\nWhere futures markets and flavors entwine.\n\nThe third day dost thou leave Tokyo’s embrace\nFor Kyoto where tradition doth linger still.\nAt Kawaramachi thy lodging let it be\nNear Gion’s streets where the geisha do glide.\nFirst to Kiyomizu’s temple high and grand\nWhere wooden stages o’er valleys do peer.\nThe otters of Arashiyama’s river watch thee pass\nAs bamboo groves in the wind do sway.\nFushimi’s sake distilleries whisper their lore\nWhere rice and water do magic bestow.\n\nOn the fourth day let thine adventurous spirit rise\nTo Nara where deer do freely roam.\nTodai-ji’s Buddha with eyes so grand\nShall gaze upon thee with ancient grace.\nThen to Osaka’s heart where street food doth call\nAnd takoyaki balls in the air do spin.\nDotonbori’s lights paint the night in hue\nWhere crab and octopus in glory do reign.\n\nThe fifth day dost thou journey to Hiroshima’s shore\nWhere history’s weight doth heavily rest.\nThe Peace Memorial where souls do abide\nIn silent vigil o’er time’s cruel test.\nThen to Miyajima’s floating shrine thou dost glide\nWhere torii emerges from waters so deep.\nThe sixth day let Kanazawa’s charm thee ensnare\nWhere geisha in Higashi’s quarter do tread.\nKenrokuen’s gardens with beauty untold\nShall fill thy soul with a peace most profound.\n\nOn the seventh day return dost thou to Tokyo’s light\nWhere Roppongi’s hills or Shinjuku’s fire\nShall crown thy journey with one final flair.\nThe Tokyo Skytree or Rainbow Bridge’s span\nLet thine last evening in this realm be graced\nWith fireworks or views of the city so vast.\n\nBefore the dawn on the eighth day thou must part\nFrom Nihon’s shores where thy adventure did start.\nYet memories of temples and lanterns so bright\nAnd sushi and sake shall forever burn light\nIn thy heart as thy tale of Japan unfolds\nIn verses and stories through many a land.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.16029712557792664}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.003225721186026931}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -3.1117587089538574}, {"token": " Let", "logprob": -1.2435888051986694}, {"token": " me", "logprob": -1.2824854850769043}, {"token": " we", "logprob": -0.37055400013923645}, {"token": "ave", "logprob": -1.6331539882230572e-05}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.2832127809524536}, {"token": "e", "logprob": -0.0031583448871970177}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -0.836934506893158}, {"token": " itiner", "logprob": -0.2533981204032898}, {"token": "ary", "logprob": -0.0005675135762430727}, {"token": " most", "logprob": -0.23179295659065247}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.7989524602890015}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.2860492765903473}, {"token": "For", "logprob": -1.0965790748596191}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -0.06720103323459625}, {"token": " grand", "logprob": -2.2209055423736572}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -2.927602529525757}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.5849500894546509}, {"token": " N", "logprob